      "label": "sdc01_0390_sister_08",
      "hash64": "CCCBBF1E99C693D3",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]I’ll record everything we found out about those\\nthree to your Rotom Phone,\\r\\n[VAR 0x0100(0000)].\\r\\nThat way\\r\\nwe\\r\\nwon’t\\r\\nforget\\r\\nany\\r\\nof it![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
